{"id":"cerveza","lemma":"cerveza","pos":"noun","rank":729,"glosses":["beer"],"ipa":"/θeɾˈbeθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cervezas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-cerveza.wav","formAudio":{"cervezas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-cervezas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La cerveza es buena.","en":"Beer's good.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/103390"},{"text":"Dos cervezas, por favor.","en":"Two beers, please.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449801"},{"text":"Me encanta la cerveza.","en":"I love beer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/296252"},{"text":"Solo me tomé un par de cervezas.","en":"I only had a couple beers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/249328"},{"text":"Esa es mi cerveza.","en":"That's my beer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799906"}]}